a `env` or extra action), the two Actions pinned to the same commit ids as `lint.yml`, the install command word for word, and the scan command word for word (so a new flag, a `--config=...` or `--exclude=...` form, another pack or a missing folder fails). They also refuse an expression such as `github.event.`, `github.head_ref` or `github.ref_name` inside a `run:` step and any secret or token reference. These tests do not prove the workflow is safe or that it scans correctly on GitHub; they pin its shape and the retry logic (against a stand-in `semgrep`).
